        },
        {
          "text": "O mwana amuntu, bantu aba balibikide myoyo yabo kuzikozyano zyabo, acilebyo camilandu yabo balicibikide kumeso aabo. Sa ndakonzya kuzumina kuti babuzye makani kulindime? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kobaambila kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Kufumbwa muntu waluzubo lwa-Israyeli uubika moyo wakwe kuzikozyano zyakwe, alimwi ulabika cilebyo camilandu yakwe kumeso aakwe, elyo ulaboola kumusinsimi, mebo nde Jehova njoomuvwiila ndemwini, nkaambo kabunji bwazikozyano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
