        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kufumbwa muntu waluzubo lwa-Israyeli, na wabeenzu bakala-kala akati kaba-Israyeli, uulyaandaanya kulindime, uubika moyo wakwe kuzikozyano zyakwe akubika cilebyo camilandu yakwe kubusyu bwakwe, lino uleza kumusinsimi kuti abuzye makani kulindime, mebo nde-Jehova njoomuvwiila ndemwini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
