          "text": "Alimwi musinsimi na waongelezegwa kwaamba ijwi, ndime nde-Jehova ndaongelezya oyo musinsimi, nkabela njootandabika ijanza lyangu kulinguwe akumunyonyoona mukati kabantu bangu ba-Israyeli. ",
